{"3193670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sorry! I surrounded beauty!", "steam_appid": 3193670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/41bf04708224a0b4ee613362a1e34b76.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sorry! I Surrounded By Beauty&quot; is a full-motion live-action interactive video dating simulation game. As the protagonist, Chen Mo, you are a young and promising individual in the early stages of your career. However, you face unexpected professional setbacks and the emotional entanglements that follow. You will encounter beauties with distinct personalities, joining them to uncover the hidden truths behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 912619095</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our community! ~~~ Fan group events are ongoing! ~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhou Liuliu</strong>: A dual-natured girl who can be sweet or fiery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/2e3b5099b0971893dea78df1d99311ca.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/2e3b5099b0971893dea78df1d99311ca.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/2e3b5099b0971893dea78df1d99311ca.mp4?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shen Ruo</strong>: Your childhood friend and accomplished lawyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/7df10f871330025008ec48a15f10d1bf.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/7df10f871330025008ec48a15f10d1bf.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/7df10f871330025008ec48a15f10d1bf.mp4?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Li Yuner</strong>: A retired idol who wears her emotions on her sleeve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/d2dc6bee0cb8e5f9433e6180aeb64b1b.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/d2dc6bee0cb8e5f9433e6180aeb64b1b.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/d2dc6bee0cb8e5f9433e6180aeb64b1b.mp4?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yang Jie</strong>: A gentle and caring assistant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/c71b88e3c2682a0abd1ca6fb5ca01073.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/c71b88e3c2682a0abd1ca6fb5ca01073.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/c71b88e3c2682a0abd1ca6fb5ca01073.mp4?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meng Yourong</strong>: A romantic yet strong-willed business woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/6169f037ccac74d64bd3afed72b9800c.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/6169f037ccac74d64bd3afed72b9800c.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/6169f037ccac74d64bd3afed72b9800c.mp4?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Product Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. ​​Immersive Experience​​</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​First-Person Perspective​</strong>​: The game utilizes full-motion live-action filming with a first-person viewpoint, creating an unparalleled sense of immersion. Players feel as if they are truly interacting with characters in real-world scenarios, with dynamic camera angles enhancing emotional engagement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​Realistic Interactions​</strong>​: Scenes are designed with authentic settings and emotional depth, such as tense office environments or intimate café moments, where choices directly impact relationships and plot progression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. ​​Rich Storytelling​​</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​Multi-Layered Narrative​</strong>​: The game weaves together a main storyline with character-specific branches, revealing hidden truths as players delve deeper. Each heroine—like the dual-natured Zhou Liuliu or the retired idol Li Yuner—has a unique backstory that intertwines with the protagonist's journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​30+ Endings &amp; 80+ Branches​</strong>​: With over 30 endings and 80 branching paths, player decisions lead to vastly different outcomes, ensuring high replayability. The &quot;true ending&quot; requires uncovering secrets through repeated playthroughs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. ​​Interactive Gameplay​​</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​QTE Challenges​</strong>​: Quick-Time Events (QTEs) are integrated to heighten tension and engagement, testing players' reflexes during critical moments and influencing story direction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​Hidden Content​</strong>​: Discoverable Easter eggs, hidden achievements, and collectible character art reward exploration, adding layers of depth beyond the main plot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We extend our deepest gratitude to the pioneers and trailblazers in the game industry. Their relentless efforts have forged innovative creative pathways, redefining the future of game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emergence of new game genres brings both opportunities and challenges. Throughout the development process, we encountered and resolved numerous obstacles, paving the way for innovative storytelling and gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any suggestions or feedback while playing the game, we warmly encourage you to reach out to us. Your insights are invaluable in shaping a better experience for everyone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QQ Group: <strong>912619095</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/41bf04708224a0b4ee613362a1e34b76.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sorry! I Surrounded By Beauty&quot; is a full-motion live-action interactive video dating simulation game. As the protagonist, Chen Mo, you are a young and promising individual in the early stages of your career. However, you face unexpected professional setbacks and the emotional entanglements that follow. You will encounter beauties with distinct personalities, joining them to uncover the hidden truths behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 912619095</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our community! ~~~ Fan group events are ongoing! ~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zhou Liuliu</strong>: A dual-natured girl who can be sweet or fiery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/2e3b5099b0971893dea78df1d99311ca.poster.avif?t=1747987628\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193670/extras/2e3b5099b0971893dea78df1d99311ca.webm?t=1747987628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193